    "created_at": "2015-10-06T04:55:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-06T04:55:14Z",
    "body": "That seems reasonable until you realize that it's like this almost everywhere in HTML. If we were to add a note for everything that is different between author requirements and UA requirements the spec would be much longer. :-) But maybe the microsyntax section is a good place to have more notes about this since many parts of the spec point to it...\n",
